{
 "about": "HeartGold/SoulSilver story steps for the guide panel's NEXT section, written by hand for this site. Each todo line is [text, condition, place, help]; place (optional) is where it happens: a map id (hgss.json), [map id, x, z] for a spot on it, or \"HG id|SS id\". Clicking the bullet shows the way there. help (optional) is a small line under it: quiz answers, puzzle tips. Conditions are read from the save data in DS RAM: f:N event flag (fly-point flags 0x9B0+ mark towns visited), t:N trainer beaten, b:N Johto badge bit, k:N Kanto badge bit, v:VAR>=N story variable (hex id); | is any, & is all (binds tighter). An empty condition is shown as a plain bullet. A step also counts as done once any later step is done, unless it is free (Kanto gyms: any order). Text in {HeartGold|SoulSilver} picks the version. A boss's \"won\" condition ticks it (scripted battles like rivals, leaders and executives never set the trainer-beaten flag, so t:N only works for ordinary trainers). Boss teams and catch sprites come from bosses.json (tools/story_data.py); a Rival with t: [a, b, c] is picked by the player's starter (Chikorita, Cyndaquil, Totodile). types/weak are type names shown as icons. \"opt\" lists optional side quests worth doing at that point, with the same kind of conditions; c:N is National Dex N caught (Pokédex in the save).",
